   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Also on the phone\n\n\u2022 A hand left the picture during or as the\n   sign ends: [?] with a framing hint\n\u2022 A signed answer the agent's question\n   offers (YES, TOMORROW, ...) answers it\n\u2022 8 chip words: hello, thank you, yes,\n   no, now, please, tomorrow, wait\n   (morning: iPhone test pending)",
   "originalText": "Also on the phone\n\n\u2022 A hand left the picture during or as the\n   sign ends: [?] with a framing hint\n\u2022 A signed answer the agent's question\n   offers (YES, TOMORROW, ...) answers it\n\u2022 8 chip words: hello, thank you, yes,\n   no, now, please, tomorrow, wait\n   (morning: iPhone test pending)",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
