   "text": "iPhone app (SwiftUI)\n\n\u2022 Camera, MediaPipe Holistic\n\u2022 ASL Signs model via LiteRT\n\u2022 Sign detector and the rule (3)\n\u2022 Screens: Home, Get ready, Call,\n   Brief, Notes\n\u2022 Holds no API keys",
   "originalText": "iPhone app (SwiftUI)\n\n\u2022 Camera, MediaPipe Holistic\n\u2022 ASL Signs model via LiteRT\n\u2022 Sign detector and the rule (3)\n\u2022 Screens: Home, Get ready, Call,\n   Brief, Notes\n\u2022 Holds no API keys",
