   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1728703112,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 3595294803,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1793088000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Safety rules\n\n\u2022 Nothing is spoken unless you tapped SEND (live call) or\n   approved the brief (call for me).\n\u2022 Unsure recognition stays silent: [?] or \"did you mean\", never a guess.\n\u2022 The agent never agrees to anything outside the brief: it asks\n   you, or says it will call back.\n\u2022 The draft may reword your signs but never adds a day, time,\n   number or name.\n\u2022 Calls go only to allowlisted, consenting numbers, from\n   Ishara's calling number (Bolna's), and say they are for a Deaf caller.",
   "originalText": "Safety rules\n\n\u2022 Nothing is spoken unless you tapped SEND (live call) or\n   approved the brief (call for me).\n\u2022 Unsure recognition stays silent: [?] or \"did you mean\", never a guess.\n\u2022 The agent never agrees to anything outside the brief: it asks\n   you, or says it will call back.\n\u2022 The draft may reword your signs but never adds a day, time,\n   number or name.\n\u2022 Calls go only to allowlisted, consenting numbers, from\n   Ishara's calling number (Bolna's), and say they are for a Deaf caller.",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "rules",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
