   "seed": 1257512261,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1162698308,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1793088000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Status, 28 October\n\n\u2022 Built and tested in the iOS simulator: both call modes, and the\n   ASL model running inside the app.\n\u2022 Public ASL clips, app and Mac: 0 wrong chips with the shipped\n   settings; same decision on 17 of 18 parity clips.\n\u2022 Real Bolna calls passed: Live and all three Call-for-me flows,\n   from the simulator app with sign videos as the camera.\n\u2022 Not yet: the iPhone (camera, speed, phone clips, final cut-offs).\n\u2022 No Deaf user has tested it. ISL is the goal; it is blocked by data.",
   "originalText": "Status, 28 October\n\n\u2022 Built and tested in the iOS simulator: both call modes, and the\n   ASL model running inside the app.\n\u2022 Public ASL clips, app and Mac: 0 wrong chips with the shipped\n   settings; same decision on 17 of 18 parity clips.\n\u2022 Real Bolna calls passed: Live and all three Call-for-me flows,\n   from the simulator app with sign videos as the camera.\n\u2022 Not yet: the iPhone (camera, speed, phone clips, final cut-offs).\n\u2022 No Deaf user has tested it. ISL is the goal; it is blocked by data.",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "status",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "title",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 40,
