   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Architecture as of 28 October 2026 (decisions D1, D8, D9 in PLAN.md). Blue runs on the iPhone, yellow on our backend, purple at Bolna, green is the user's own action.",
   "originalText": "Architecture as of 28 October 2026 (decisions D1, D8, D9 in PLAN.md). Blue runs on the iPhone, yellow on our backend, purple at Bolna, green is the user's own action.",
